==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|frm|imperturbable}}, from {{der|en|LL.|imperturbābilis}}, from {{m|la|im-}} + {{m|la|perturbō}} + {{m|la|-bilis}}. Surface analysis {{m|en|im-}} + {{m|en|perturbable}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˌɪmpəˈtɜːbəbəl/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˌɪmpɚˈtɝbəbəl/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Not easily [[perturb]]ed, [[upset]] or [[excited]].
# [[calm|Calm]] and [[collected]], even under [[pressure]].

